					Title:  "远程管理总开关",
					Layout: VBox{Margins: Margins{10, 8, 10, 8}, Spacing: 6},
					Children: []Widget{
						Composite{
							Layout: HBox{MarginsZero: true, Spacing: 8},
							Children: []Widget{
								CheckBox{
									AssignTo:         &a.manageChk,
